# Vendored third-party wrappers only.
#
# These are copied from GENECI by `python -m multigcn.inference.vendor` and are
# not ours to redistribute in this repo. Listed by exact filename on purpose:
# a blanket `scripts/r/*.R` also excludes MultiGCN's OWN wrappers, which then
# vanish on a fresh clone and get silently replaced by GENECI's incompatible
# versions during vendoring.
multigcn/inference/scripts/r/ARACNE.R
